From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:44:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] prts: remote windows maximized and frameless; runtime screen
 geometry setter

Remote mode: browser windows show maximized with no caption buttons, resize
border or non-client hit areas. ScreenWinHeadless::SetPrimaryDisplayGeometry
lets the viewer's SetViewport update the headless screen at runtime.

Patch-Name: 15-remote-window

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/browser_desktop_window_tree_host_win.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/browser_desktop_window_tree_host_win.cc
